        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDL980, Storm and Screen Door Latch Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSolid brass tubular storm or screen door lever and latch set. It can be used for wood or metal screen doors and storm doors. Fits doors 7/8\" to 1-3/8\" thick. Available in your choice of 5 popular finishes. Manufactured by Deltana, the architectural hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDL980-Specifications.gif?v=1704354591\" width=\"521\" height=\"244\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDL980 Screen Door Latch Set Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDL980 Screen Door Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Knob Projection: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for doors 7/8\" - 1-3/8\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Privacy button locks spindle & latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible handling.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDL980.pdf?v=1691095375\" target =\"new\"><b>Deltana SDL980 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
